Subject: [PATCH] Switch site to Vote Maximizer v43 JSON export

- Loaders read public/data/races/*.json and reference/*.json (vm_export_json.py schema)
- Race detail: margin source badge (Polling/Estimate), win probability (Senate/Governor),
