  last-verified date and FiftyPlusOne credit
- Margin labels handle independents and ballot measures (+0.8 Ind, +4 Yes)
- Fix compare view Data Source always showing 'Poll'
- About page data-sources text updated
- DATA.md documents the data drop

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
